Milestone 3 literature corpus
-----------------------------

The approved M3 pilot is an exact eleven-document Europe PMC OA JATS corpus. Each approved
document manifest row records CC-BY-4.0, its article-specific evidence URI, checksum, retrieval
timestamp, and approval state. The permission is document-scoped; it is not a blanket license for
Europe PMC or for unlisted articles. Corpus source bytes are not distributed in Git, the Python
packages, or the container image. Attribution and the applicable CC-BY-4.0 terms must be retained
when an authorized local corpus is rebuilt.

